From 1d98ea3a4866abf21ee29831ed9441f4dfe904b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andreas Heider <andreas@heider.io>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:36:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] ipu7: pipeline handler and IPA for the Intel IPU7
 hardware ISP

Add a pipeline handler for Intel IPU7 (Panther Lake / IPU7.5) that drives
the hardware ISP through the PSYS character device of Intel's GPL kernel
driver, without Intel's closed userspace libraries:

- ISYS raw capture -> PSYS LBFF (Bayer to YUV) -> PSYS BBPS (TNR, output)
- one NV12 1920x1080 stream, IMX471 sensor
- graph and register templates loaded from data files

The ipu7 IPA generates the ISP parameters (white balance, statistics
colour path, tone/gamma LUTs, lens shading strength, denoise strength)
and runs AE/AWB from the hardware RGBS grid and histograms, configured
by an imx471.yaml tuning file.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
